th over 50 different cosmetics and emotes to collect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498760/extras/f4ba7cd1f8437bbf42d0022af0e7f920.avif?t=1786635946\" width=616 height=100 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498760/extras/e8da71b0ea400f94e832c7d6fd42dd02.poster.avif?t=1786635946\" width=780 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498760/extras/e8da71b0ea400f94e832c7d6fd42dd02.webm?t=1786635946\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498760/extras/e8da71b0ea400f94e832c7d6fd42dd02.mp4?t=1786635946\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Approve book requests, sort returns, repair books, and handle special requests to earn credit to spend at the Library Store or on Perk Pops to improve your Librarian's abilities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498760/extras/0546b3e6a49def516972b9e0170640a5.avif?t=1786635946\" width=616 height=100 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498760/extras/670a8f2e54df3a8c89a01b87f3e42de1.poster.avif?t=1786635946\" width=780 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498760/extras/670a8f2e54df3a8c89a01b87f3e42de1.webm?t=1786635946\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498760/extras/670a8f2e54df3a8c89a01b87f3e42de1.mp4?t=1786635946\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The library isn’t just a place of knowledge... It’s a labyrinth filled with dark secrets and terrifying entities. Discover the mystery behind the library’s curse… if you can survive long enough to do so.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can you keep the library running and survive the night shift?</strong></p>", "short_description": "Unshelved is an up to 4-player co-op Work-Life Horror Sim where you manage a cursed library. By day, handle book requests and earn an honest living. But as night falls, you must return books to their shelves and survive the horrors that haunt the halls!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498760/a187d4da9039ff355caedb62361538a3009471e0/header.jpg?t=1786635946", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498760/c035187012cbde92c9d96b618c6a14050475a9b4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786635946", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498760/c035187012cbde92c9d96b618c6a14050475a9b4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786635946", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 3 1200 / Intel i5-7400 (quad-core, 4 threads)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> AMD RX 560 / NVIDIA GTX 950 (2–4 GB VRAM)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Playable at 1080p Low settings. Frame rate may dip below 30 FPS in busy areas; occ